How an AI-Activity setup comes into being and is kept in shape: discover activities, install from the templates tree (left, shared across projects) into this repo (right), inspect and trim the startup chain, then use it (see the usage workflow) and maintain it. Green arrows are writes by aiActivity.cs (dashed = symlink, solid = copy); red arrows are writes by Claude; grey arrows mark the templates as source. Fill shows read / write / read-write; dashed borders are 'perhaps'.
